    // Residuals below the minimum possible item size (1) are impossible, but residuals
    // in the "dead zone" (small, unlikely to fit future items) are heavily penalized.
    // Model the dead zone as residual < 10 (smaller than any typical item) with a
    // graduated penalty that grows as the residual shrinks toward 0.
